From c910e5d25ba675ac2bfc97d35f14a4cc0314864f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dain Nilsson <dain@yubico.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Apr 2025 20:01:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Override version checks for 0.0.1

---
